sequenceDiagram
  participant P as /admin/page.tsx
  participant S as admin.service.ts
  participant DB as Supabase DB

  P->>S: getAdminMetrics()
  Note over S: Promise.all — parallel batches
  par Batch 1
    S->>DB: count bookings this month
    S->>DB: count upcoming today
    S->>DB: sum revenue this month
  and Batch 2
    S->>DB: count total customers
    S->>DB: count unread messages
    S->>DB: count total services
  end
  DB-->>S: all results
  S-->>P: AdminMetrics object
  P->>P: render metric cards
